{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>For Pharaoh's horse came.</b> It follows from above, to the beginning of the song, ״אז ישיר משה ובני ישראל״ — when Pharaoh's horse came with his chariot and with his horsemen into the sea, and HaShem returned the waters of the sea upon them, and the children of Israel walked on dry land. Scripture explains that while Israel were passing through it on dry ground, they were singing this song."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:59:38.855700534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}